    <briefdescription>
<para>Native Zero-Heap DTLS 1.3 Datagram Protocol Engine (RFC 9147). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implements Datagram Transport Layer Security (DTLS) version 1.3:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Unified record header format (RFC 9147 Section 4)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>64-packet sliding window anti-replay protection (RFC 9147 Section 4.5.2)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Epoch-based key scheduling &amp; AEAD record encryption/decryption</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Pre-Shared Key (PSK), Raw Public Key (RPK), and X.509 modes</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Full pluggability into <ref refid="structSYN__Transport" kindref="compound">SYN_Transport</ref> (UDP, wireless, serial, etc.) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
